        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By blending our thought leadership and industry expertise with capabilities from innovative technology vendors, we are able to enhance the accuracy, speed, and scalability of delivery across our tax advisory, valuation, and consulting offerings.",
        "start_character": 5778,
        "end_character": 6023
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we are leveraging an AI platform to review due diligence materials, streamline process management, and assist in contract negotiations in connection with our acquisition strategy and business combinations.",
        "start_character": 20081,
        "end_character": 20299
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our foundation as a leading tax practice, we have expanded our service offerings to include a broad array of capabilities.",
        "start_character": 11015,
        "end_character": 11152
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we operate a low Managing Director-to-professional operating model and high ratio of client-facing employees, resulting in greater direct Managing Director interaction, greater accountability for service delivery and timelier responsiveness to client needs.",
        "start_character": 5366,
        "end_character": 5636
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our use of AI extends beyond our delivery of services to our clients, and reaches how we operate our own business.",
        "start_character": 19966,
        "end_character": 20080
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since our inception, we have made a deliberate decision not to provide audit or related financial statement attestation services.",
        "start_character": 2389,
        "end_character": 2518
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Specifically, through our Business Tax Services practice, we offer the following services:",
        "start_character": 15654,
        "end_character": 15744
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "This means that we can offer our clients a comprehensive suite of non-audit services, tailored to their specific needs, without being subject to the auditor independence rules and other restrictions that impact many of our competitors.",
        "start_character": 10712,
        "end_character": 10947
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a leading provider of independent tax, valuation and financial advisory services to individuals and family offices, businesses and institutional clients in the United States.",
        "start_character": 529,
        "end_character": 710
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our relationship with Andersen Consulting will enable us to rapidly scale our ability to offer a broader range of consulting services globally.",
        "start_character": 22773,
        "end_character": 22927
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We could experience additional competition as we expand our service offerings, enter new geographic markets and acquire businesses and enter into business combinations in the future.",
        "start_character": 32278,
        "end_character": 32460
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-128949",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-128949-3a90b84d8fdb21ab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-128949",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have built a multidimensional independent advisory firm with the ability to provide differentiated services across tax and financial services to address our clients’ most complex challenges.",
        "start_character": 1243,
        "end_character": 1436
      }
